{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794491187,"nonce":"yBUZzciQeWq+kRI2H4UHNHYmSNo=","title":"Maeve UI: iced app, Layout A, theme and screenshots","message":"## Goal\nThe desktop app: one scrolling compare screen (Layout A), plus history and settings screens. It uses the tweakcn theme in light, dark and system modes, works in ES and EN, and is visually checked through screenshots.\n\n## Context\n- Builds on core epic 3bc0ebb (library in `src/lib.rs`: domain, scrape, llm, pipeline, store, settings)\n- Spec UI and Theme sections: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-12-maeve-design.md:101`, `:112`\n- Plan Tasks 3 and 11–15: `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-12-maeve.md:153`, `:413`–`:499`. Every layer must follow Global Constraints (`:13`), including the screenshot review loop\n\n## Layers (merge bottom-up)\n1. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L1 — tweakcn theme port to iced and ES/EN string catalogue\n2. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L2 — App shell, header, theme/language switching and screenshot harness\n3. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L3 — Input card and Compare flow with live progress\n4. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L4 — Results card: verdict, stats table, bars, debate\n5. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L5 — Paste-instead fallback for failed scrapes\n6. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L6 — History and Settings screens\n7. \u003ckey TBD\u003e — L7 — Visual polish pass, README, delete docs/theme.css\n\n## Out of scope\n- Core logic changes beyond what a layer explicitly names\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Every child Task merged\n- `cargo run` with a real Gemini key compares two real listings end to end; snaps in `target/snaps/` look right in light/dark × ES/EN","files":null}]}